Set ``-DSHIELD=seeed_xiao_6x10_rgb_matrix`` and use optional the
:ref:`snippet-usb-console` when you invoke ``west build``.
For example:

.. tabs::

   .. zephyr-keep-sorted-start re(^\s{3}\.\. group-tab:: \w)

   .. group-tab:: BLE (Sense)

      .. rubric:: On XIAO BLE

      .. zephyr-app-commands::
         :app: bridle/samples/helloshell
         :build-dir: seeed_xiao_6x10_rgb_matrix-helloshell
         :board: xiao_ble/nrf52840
         :shield: "seeed_xiao_6x10_rgb_matrix"
         :gen-args: \
            -DCONFIG_LED_STRIP=y -DCONFIG_LED_STRIP_SHELL=y -DCONFIG_LED_STRIP_SHELL_MAX_PIXELS=60
         :west-args: -p
         :flash-args: -r uf2
         :goals: flash
         :host-os: unix

      .. rubric:: On XIAO BLE Sense

      .. zephyr-app-commands::
         :app: bridle/samples/helloshell
         :build-dir: seeed_xiao_6x10_rgb_matrix-helloshell
         :board: xiao_ble/nrf52840/sense
         :shield: "seeed_xiao_6x10_rgb_matrix"
         :gen-args: \
            -DCONFIG_LED_STRIP=y -DCONFIG_LED_STRIP_SHELL=y -DCONFIG_LED_STRIP_SHELL_MAX_PIXELS=60
         :west-args: -p
         :flash-args: -r uf2
         :goals: flash
         :host-os: unix

      .. include:: helloshell_console_nrf52.rsti

